Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: Apps
Priority: optional
MinimumOSVersion: @MIN_IOS@
Description: The Ladybird browser for iPhone and iPad
 Ladybird (https://ladybird.org) is a new web browser with its own engine, written
 from scratch rather than built on WebKit or Chromium. This package installs it as a
 normal home-screen app: tap the icon and the browser opens.
 .
 The same package id is available as scheme-specific rootless and rootful builds
 for 64-bit devices on iOS 16 or later. iPad is tested; iPhone is declared but
 remains untested, so the toolbar is tight and the keyboard can cover the page.
